# Guards whose falsification receipt does not yet say how to score it again.
#
# A guard that cannot be re-validated quickly is defective on its own terms: it claims to
# catch something and records no way to check that claim a second time.  The four fields a
# receipt owes, and the failure each was earned from, are in
# `scripts/falsify-review.py` and doc/claude/TESTING.md.
#
# This is a RATCHET keyed by file name.  It only ever shrinks: a new guard must meet the
# standard, and a line here must be deleted once its guard does.  Do not add to it.
#
# ⚠ IT IS NOW EMPTY, and that is the point: the debt started at 344 receipts and reached
# zero, so `doc_hygiene::every_guard_says_how_to_score_it_again` is a plain requirement
# rather than a ratchet — a guard whose receipt does not say how to score it fails the
# gate outright.  Do not re-add a line here to get a new guard past it; write the fields.
